COMMENT ON COLUMN audience.segment.sow_id IS 'Foreign key linking to contract.sow. Business justification: Campaign-specific custom segments are frequently defined as SOW deliverables with specific build criteria, acceptance thresholds, and delivery timelines. Essential for scope validation, deliverable tr LOGICAL REF -> crm_db.contract.sow.sow_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN audience.segment.taxonomy_id IS 'Foreign key linking to audience.taxonomy. Business justification: Segments should be formally classified using the standardized audience taxonomy (aligned to IAB Audience Taxonomy per audience_taxonomy product description). The segment table currently has ''iab_taxon';
